incident :the_wing_lok_counter_complaint do
  name "The Wing Lok Counter-Complaint"
  tags :trade, :legibility, :biotech, :computation
  prominence :marginal

  prose <<~PROSE
    A sensory interface built to order on a #{ref :severed_strains, "severed strain"} by a Guangzhou house of #{ref :the_brokers, "the Brokers"}, sold in 2088 to a workshop in #{ref :the_dead_counties, "the Dead Counties"} and paid for with a #{ref :feral_models, "feral"} rather than in coin. Two articles crossed and both were drawn: a tissue slip into a copper tube, a model onto a block of #{ref :witness_glass, "witness glass"}, sealed the same afternoon and lodged at #{ref :wing_lok_godown, "Wing Lok"} in one term on one line.

    Neither party bought the upper tier. The interface was cheap partly because nobody paid for a flush.
  PROSE

  prose <<~PROSE, section: :course, heading: "Three Hundred And Fifty Days"
    The workshop filed on the three hundred and fiftieth day of the term, naming the defect — the article reached for a terminal it had been sold as unable to find — and giving the day it first did so. The article came up the stairs to the damp room. The bench cut the lodged slip, raised a flush off it, and put the flush in front of the house's test plate.

    On the eleventh day the flush seated on the contact pattern and put fibre into the cast contacts. The term had closed six days earlier. The Guangzhou house held that the term had run and the halves were due for destruction; the godown answered that a complaint received inside the term holds both halves until the bench has decided it, and printed that sentence on its receipts from the following season.

    The defect was in the article as drawn. The strain was not severed on the day it was sealed.
  PROSE

  prose <<~PROSE, section: :aftermath, heading: "The Block Was Not Read"
    The Guangzhou house filed in turn against the payment, claiming the model delivered had been retrained after the draw and was not the model on the block. The block would have settled it, and reading the block would have ended the block: the workshop would have had its feral separated into broken glass and a working copy in a Wing Lok room, in front of the people it had just been in dispute with.

    The house withdrew the counter-complaint on the fourth day of it. At the close the block was crushed unread and the tube's contents autoclaved beside it, both entered on the same line under the workshop's counterfoil number. The workshop has drawn against every article it has bought since and buys the upper tier on living stock, because a flush took eleven days to answer a question a seal could not.
  PROSE

  log "2026-08-09 — The complaint arrives late in the term and is decided after it closes on purpose: escrow release turns on proof of a stated condition, and the interval that decides who bears a latent defect is the one part of the arrangement neither party can argue with once it is printed. The godown's holding rule — a complaint received inside the term holds the halves until the bench decides — is the concrete thing this case added to the practice."
end
